## The lab

{% interactive id="lab" reserve="clamp(max(min(41.25cqi + 0.75px, 402px) + 1.75rem, 20.5rem) + 25rem, (44rem - 100cqi) * 9999, clamp(min(min(62.5cqi + 0.75px, 402px), var(--interactive-max-block-size) - 18.25rem), (min(62.5cqi + 0.75px, 402px) * 0.5 + 18.25rem - var(--interactive-max-block-size)) * 9999, min(62.5cqi + 0.75px, 402px)) + max(6.5rem, 12.25rem - 16cqi) + clamp(38.125rem, (30rem - 100cqi) * 9999, 44.5rem))" caption="The talk’s last pipeline, cellular → cull → start → exit → hot-path, on seed 7. Change the pipeline, a control or the seed; step through the build; then walk the map to its exit." params={mode: "lab", recipe: {format: "map-lab-recipe/1", seed: 7, width: 80, height: 50, pipeline: [{stage: "cellular", wall_percent: 55, iterations: 10}, {stage: "cull", from: "center", mode: "remove"}, {stage: "start", at: "left"}, {stage: "exit", at: "right"}, {stage: "hot-path", radius: 10, cull: 15}]}} %}
{% steps %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c20-0011-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c20-0011-dark.png" alt="Caves, hot path cull, seed 7: the map at step 11 of 18." key="cellular.iterate" at=11 of=18 %}
**A pass:** every tile inside the map’s outer ring counts the walls among its 8 neighbors, in a copy of the map made before the pass {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c03-cellular/src/main.rs#L40-L70" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s79" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s80" /%}. 5 or more, or none: wall. 1 to 4: floor {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c03-cellular/src/main.rs#L61-L66" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s81" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s82" /%}. Pass {% value %}10{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c20-0013-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c20-0013-dark.png" alt="Caves, hot path cull, seed 7: the map at step 13 of 18." key="cull.removed" at=13 of=18 %}
**Removed:** open tiles that the open tile nearest the center can’t walk to are turned to wall {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c17-starting-left/src/main.rs#L34-L67" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s230" /%}. Tiles removed: {% value %}31{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c20-0015-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c20-0015-dark.png" alt="Caves, hot path cull, seed 7: the map at step 15 of 18." key="start.placed" at=15 of=18 %}
**Start:** the open tile nearest that point, in a straight line {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c17-starting-left/src/main.rs#L71-L86" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s242" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s243" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c20-0016-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c20-0016-dark.png" alt="Caves, hot path cull, seed 7: the map at step 16 of 18." key="exit.placed" at=16 of=18 %}
**Exit:** the open tile nearest the middle of the right edge. Then the route from the start to it is found {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c18-ending-right/src/main.rs#L92-L111" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s247" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s248" /%}. Steps on the shortest route: {% value %}99{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% step src="assets/steps/c20-0018-light.png" dark="assets/steps/c20-0018-dark.png" alt="Caves, hot path cull, seed 7: the map at step 18 of 18." key="hot-path.culled" at=18 of=18 %}
**Cull:** tiles at the cull distance or farther from the route become wall. The talk’s demo culls at 15, wider than the 10 of its hot path {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c20-hot-path/src/main.rs#L131-L154" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s263" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s264" /%}. Cull distance: {% value %}15{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c20-hot-path.json --seed 7`.
{% /interactive %}

- **What this is:** a lab for the techniques of Herbert Wolverson’s talk *Procedural Map Generation Techniques*: algorithms that generate maps, then algorithms that fix them and find out whether they are usable {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s3" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s4" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s5" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s6" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s7" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s8" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s9" /%}.
- **A recipe:** a pipeline of those techniques and a seed. Same recipe, same map {% own /%}.
- **The lab,** above: builds a recipe step by step. Edit it, measure it over 200 seeds, walk it {% own /%}.
- **Each card,** below: the rule · step-through · controls · measured traits · failures · combinations · faithfulness to the talk’s code {% own /%}.

## Choosing a technique

- **Each row:** a criterion of our own, and the demos whose measured traits meet it {% own-run values="table.guide" /%}.

{% table label="Techniques by need" rowheads=true %}
* If the map needs
* Our criterion
* The talk’s demos that meet it, each with its median
---
* One connected map on every seed
* One region on all 200 seeds
* [Random rooms](#rooms) 1, [BSP rooms](#bsp) 1, [Drunkard’s walk](#drunkard) 1, [DLA, walking](#dla) 1, [Rooms, eroded](#dla-erode) 1, [Vault in a room](#prefab) 1, [Caves, culled](#start) 1, [Caves, exit at right](#exit) 1, [Caves, exit farthest](#exit) 1, [Caves, hot path cull](#hot-path) 1, [Rooms, hot rooms](#hot-rooms) 1
---
* No dead ends
* No dead end on any of the 200 seeds
* [Random rooms](#rooms) 0, [BSP rooms](#bsp) 0, [Vault in a room](#prefab) 0, [Rooms, hot rooms](#hot-rooms) 0
---
* Many dead ends, to hide things in
* One region on every seed, and the three highest median dead ends
* [DLA, walking](#dla) 113, [Caves, culled](#start) 60, [Caves, exit at right](#exit) 60
---
* Tight passages
* The three highest median corridor ratios, among maps of floor and wall
* [DLA, walking](#dla) 0.217, [Random rooms](#rooms) 0.190, [Vault in a room](#prefab) 0.190
---
* Open ground
* The three highest median floor shares, among maps of floor and wall
* [Voronoi cells](#voronoi) 0.836, [Cellular automata](#cellular) 0.637, [Vault on open floor](#prefab) 0.637
---
* A long walk from start to exit
* A path on every seed, and the three longest median paths
* [Rooms, hot rooms](#hot-rooms) 180.5, [BSP rooms](#bsp) 160, [Random rooms](#rooms) 149
---
* Culling before it can be played
* More than one region on every seed
* [Cellular automata](#cellular) 17, [DLA, attractor](#dla) 26, [DLA, symmetric](#dla) 25, [Voronoi cells](#voronoi) 16, [BSP + caves + spine](#combine) 11, [Vault on open floor](#prefab) 17, [Caves, unreachable marked](#cull) 17
---
* [A locked door](#lock) on every seed
* Our `lock` stage places a door on all 200 seeds; with its median chokepoints
* [Rooms, hot rooms (c21)](#rooms) 105, [BSP rooms](#bsp) 88.5, [DLA, walking](#dla) 11
