- **Talk says:** it can give you chunks of the map that you can’t get to {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s222" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s223" /%}.
- **Cellular automata:** 17 regions at the median; never fewer than 6 {% own-run values="c03.regions.median c03.regions.min" /%}.
  - **Why:** the rule says nothing about joining the caves up {% own /%}.
- **Path:** the map has no start and exit of its own, so it is measured between [our probe’s](#our-definitions) two points. On 72 of 200 seeds they lie in different caves {% own-run values="c03.path.nulls" /%}.
