* 1, 1 to 1 {% mark p10=1 median=1 p90=1 unit="seeds" to=60 trait="regions" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
* {% now trait="regions" digits=0 /%}
---
* [Dead ends](#our-definitions)
* 24, 17 to 32 {% mark p10=17 median=24 p90=32 unit="seeds" to=140 trait="dead_ends" series="c04-drunkard" /%}
* {% now trait="dead_ends" digits=0 /%}
---
