{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `mode` (`walk`, `attractor`, `symmetric`; the talk’s: `walk` in `c05`, `attractor` in `c06`, `symmetric` in `c07`) {% own /%}. How a particle travels. `walk`: a random step at a time. `attractor`: a line to the center. `symmetric`: the same, digging each tile’s mirror image too {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c05-dla/src/main.rs#L55-L80" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c06-dla-attractor/src/main.rs#L56-L68" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c07-dla-symmetry/src/main.rs#L56-L77" /%}.
- `floor_divisor` (1 to 20; the talk’s: `3`) {% own /%}. Stop when 1 / this of the map is open. All three demos: a third {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c05-dla/src/main.rs#L43" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c06-dla-attractor/src/main.rs#L43" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c07-dla-symmetry/src/main.rs#L43" /%}.
{% /part %}

