- **Talk says:** the map becomes more and more organic looking, while keeping its basic structure {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s196" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s197" /%}.
- **Floor share:** 500 particles lift it from random rooms’ 0.162 to 0.287 {% own-run values="c01.floor_share.median c08.floor_share.median" /%}.
- **Dead ends:** from 0 on every seed to 51 at the median {% own-run values="c01.dead_ends.max c08.dead_ends.median" /%}.
- **Still one piece:** 1 region on every seed {% own-run values="c08.regions.max" /%}.
  - **Why:** erosion only opens tiles next to open ones {% own /%}.
