**An input:** built on a map of its own. In the talk’s demo: rooms in subdivided space, then a cellular automata map {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c09-combination/src/main.rs#L41-L79" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c09-combination/src/main.rs#L82-L97" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s181" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s182" /%}. Input {% value %}1{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
