**Halves:** the left half of the map is copied from the first input and the right half from the second, column for column. Nothing joins them {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c09-combination/src/main.rs#L100-L114" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s183" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s184" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s185" /%}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c09-combination.json`.
{% /interactive %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
