- **No cap in the talk’s code:** both of its placement loops end only when the prefab has been placed {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c14-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L104-L124" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c15-still-not-a-trap/src/main.rs#L41-L67" /%}.
- **So:** on a map with no room big enough, or no clear patch of floor the right size, they never end {% own /%}.
- **Ours:** stops and records the seed {% own /%}.
{% /part %}

