- **Cost:** varies. Floor share after the cull: 0.424 to 0.694. The caves before it: never below 0.559 {% own-run values="c17.floor_share.min c17.floor_share.max c03.floor_share.min" /%}.
- **Talk says:** culling before picking a start avoids the extreme case, a map with only two tiles you can walk on {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s236" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s237" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s238" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s239" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s240" /%}.
