- [cellular → cull → start → exit](#recipe=eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJtYXAtbGFiLXJlY2lwZS8xIiwicGlwZWxpbmUiOlt7InN0YWdlIjoiY2VsbHVsYXIiLCJ3YWxsX3BlcmNlbnQiOjU1LCJpdGVyYXRpb25zIjoxMH0seyJzdGFnZSI6ImN1bGwiLCJmcm9tIjoiY2VudGVyIiwibW9kZSI6InJlbW92ZSJ9LHsic3RhZ2UiOiJzdGFydCIsImF0IjoibGVmdCJ9LHsic3RhZ2UiOiJleGl0IiwiYXQiOiJyaWdodCJ9XSwic2VlZCI6MX0) `c18`: an exit on the right
- [cellular → cull → start → exit](#) `c19`: the least accessible exit
- [cellular → cull → start → exit → hot-path](#) `c20`: the hot path

- **Before a start:** the talk culls before it picks one, so the player can’t be placed somewhere they can’t get out of {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s236" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s237" /%}.
- **Or put them to use:** in a game that encourages tunneling, the talk hides things in the unreachable areas {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s231" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s232" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s233" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s234" /%}.
