**Exit:** the open tile nearest the middle of the right edge. Then the route from the start to it is found {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c18-ending-right/src/main.rs#L92-L111" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s247" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s248" /%}. Steps on the shortest route: {% value %}105{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}

On the command line: `map-lab build recipes/c18-ending-right.json`, `map-lab build recipes/c19-ending-dijkstra.json`, `map-lab build recipes/own/exit-without-cull.json`.
{% /interactive %}

Also in the step-through: Caves, exit farthest; Exit without a cull (ours). The steps that differ, and each one’s last:

