**Exit:** a Dijkstra map from the start gives every tile it can reach its walking distance. The exit goes on the tile with the largest: the least accessible one {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c19-ending-dijkstra/src/main.rs#L92-L103" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s249" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s250" /%}. Steps on the shortest route: {% value %}68{% /value %}.
{% /step %}
