**No route:** the exit is placed, but nothing reaches it from the start. Without a cull, the two can land in separate caves {% own /%}.
{% /step %}
{% /steps %}
{% /part %}

{% part title="Controls" %}
- `at` (`right`, `farthest`; the talk’s: `right` in `c18`, `farthest` in `c19`) {% own /%}. `right`: the open tile nearest the middle of the right edge {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c18-ending-right/src/main.rs#L92-L109" /%}. `farthest`: the tile with the largest walking distance from the start {% cite id="wolverson2020-code/c19-ending-dijkstra/src/main.rs#L92-L101" /%}.
{% /part %}

