- **Talk says:** for a less branchy game. It removes the parts of the map that are irrelevant, so the player isn’t forced through winding labyrinths with no purpose {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s263" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s264" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s265" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s266" /%}.
