**The key:** on the start’s side of the door, shaded, on the floor tile farthest from the route {% own /%}. Talk says the key has to be before the door {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s293" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s294" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-slides/pdf#p31" /%}. Steps from the start: {% value %}35{% /value %}.
