{% part title="Controls" %}
- `key` (`before-door`, `anywhere`; ours: the talk has no code for this stage) {% own /%}. `before-door`: on the start’s side, the floor tile farthest from the route {% own /%}. `anywhere`: a random tile the start can reach with the door open, which may be behind the door {% own /%}. Talk says a key behind the door leaves a map that can’t be solved {% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s294" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s295" /%}{% cite id="wolverson2020-talk/transcript#s296" /%}.
{% /part %}

